nok: N-commit-marker: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly marker-less commits on journals with authorities; the killer asserts the guard message.\\nok: N-recover-uncertain-floor: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly unrecorded-prepare unknown probes at CR-MAT-05..07; the parked assessment must still refuse.\\nok: N-token-length: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly 3-byte tokens; every other short or long token still refuses.\\nok: C-doc-comment: SURVIVED (want SURVIVED) :: Harmless control: a comment-only edit must survive.\\nHARNESS_EXIT=0\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1541,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 386,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
